---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: How to Join
heading: Join Penn Golf Club
intro: A friendly, active membership of 600 — you need never play a round on your own here.
hero: /assets/images/penn-ladies.jpg
heroPosition: center 35%
heroCtas:
  - { label: "Make an enquiry", url: "#enquire" }
  - { label: "See prices", url: "/membership/prices/" }
---
<div class="prose-club">
  <p>Our Men's and Ladies' sections offer a full competition fixture schedule for players of all standards. Our Seniors' section is also very active, with competitions open to all comers. We have several club teams across the range of abilities, plus friendly events and a full, varied social calendar.</p>
  <p>We welcome all membership applications. Whether you're invited by a current member, joining on your own or coming as part of a group, you'll feel immediately at ease with our friendly staff and members.</p>
  <p>We have a range of payment methods to suit your circumstances. Contact our Administration Manager or Secretary for more information or an application form.</p>
</div>

<div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
  {%- for b in [
    { i: "users", t: "600 members", d: "Men's, Ladies' and Seniors' sections" },
    { i: "trophy", t: "Full fixture list", d: "Competitions for every standard" },
    { i: "calendar", t: "Social calendar", d: "Themed nights & club events" },
    { i: "star", t: "Ladies' 2-for-1", d: "Join with a friend or family member" }
  ] %}
  <div class="card p-5">
    <span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-crest-100 text-crest-600">{% icon b.i, "size-5" %}</span>
    <p class="mt-3 font-semibold text-heath-900">{{ b.t }}</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-heath-700">{{ b.d }}</p>
  </div>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>

<section class="mt-12 rounded-3xl bg-heath-900 p-6 text-white sm:p-8">
  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Joining in three easy steps</h2>
  <ol class="mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
    {%- for s in [
      { t: "Get in touch", d: "Send an enquiry below or call 01902 341142. We'll answer your questions and can arrange a visit." },
      { t: "Apply", d: "Complete the application form, online enquiry or download — whichever suits you." },
      { t: "Tee off", d: "Once approved, you'll be welcomed into the club and introduced to the sections." }
    ] %}
    <li>
      <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gorse-500 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-heath-950">{{ loop.index }}</span>
      <p class="mt-3 font-semibold">{{ s.t }}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/75">{{ s.d }}</p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-md">{% set doc = documents.applicationForm %}{% include "partials/doc-link.njk" %}</div>
</section>

<div class="mt-14">
{%- set form = {
  name: "membership-enquiry",
  title: "Membership enquiry",
  intro: "Tell us a little about yourself and we'll be in touch.",
  submit: "Send membership enquiry",
  extra: [
    { name: "membership", label: "Membership of interest", type: "select", options: ["Seven Day", "Restricted", "Five Day", "Veteran (75+)", "Young Adult (18–32)", "Junior", "Ladies' two-for-one", "PlayMoreGolf", "Not sure"] },
    { name: "handicap", label: "Handicap Index (if you have one)", placeholder: "e.g. 18.4, or none yet" },
    { name: "message", label: "Anything else?", type: "textarea" }
  ]
} %}
{% include "partials/enquiry-form.njk" %}
</div>
